    "description": "The Dyson Supersonic hair dryer is a professional-grade styling tool engineered for fast drying and precision styling across all hair types. Featuring the powerful Dyson digital motor V9 and Air Multiplier technology, it delivers a high-pressure jet of controlled air. Its intelligent heat control system measures air temperature over 40 times per second to prevent extreme heat damage and protect hair shine. This model comes with five magnetic attachments: a Flyaway attachment for a smooth finish, a styling concentrator for precision, a diffuser for curls and waves, a gentle air attachment for fine hair, and a wide-tooth comb for textured hair. It is lightweight, balanced, and includes multiple speed and heat settings, as well as negative ions to reduce static.",
